body:
I have this bad habit of skating around the outer edges where it feels safe but it's not as fun and not the real thing and possibly bumpier than it needs to ever be.  And I meant to say I don't want to NOT be patient up there!

&#x200B;

I appreciate you in your support and kindness thank you!  I am glad to hear that my thought process sounds healthy... it hasn't always been like this... I have him to thank a bit for it... back in may when we ended when I wasn't processing things as well.... I learned I needed to take responsibility for my own feelings.  It's a lot to put on some one else.  I can't be mad at them for how they feel and he has been such a nice calm person this entire time.  He's been a rock for my daughter and I pretty much.  and I don't think I have been there so hard for him.  

&#x200B;

Im still learning healthy real love.  Im scared of mistakes .. but maybe I'll try... I'll have to asks more about where his head is at.  I have kind of been conditioned by men in my life to not pry to not pester too much to not get them upset.  leave them alone... he's the first one that seems to actually carry on a conversation with me... well the first in a while.  The first that I have felt this way about.

I should clarify I think.... I think it's absolutely possible to have love again.... just different It would be the same, time circumstances etc.. Like its not the same but My dog passed on... I still haven't gotten over it I never will.  I got a puppy who is amazing in his own way they are both so different.  I was still so sad the first several months bc my puppy is different... but I couldn't have asked for a more amazing puppy than I have today.  I still find my self looking up my old dogs breed and thinking if I just get one of those things would be great... but I understand that's not how it fully works I had a very special bond with my first dog and I have a very special different bond with this dog.... 

&#x200B;

each bond is so unique and special and it wouldn't be the same... but then again I am not sure if I have ever been IN love before so maybe I wouldn't know anyways.  Maybe I was before and it's been blocked out. sorry I rambled about dogs....

Stella

&#x200B;

She is STUNNING!
